## 8. Vòng đời vận hành

### 8.1 Draw lifecycle

```
created → salesOpen → salesClosed → published → settled → (completed)
                                                        → voided (hủy kỳ)
```

### 8.2 Ticket lifecycle

```
draft → paid (immutable) → completed / refunded
```

### 8.3 Entry lifecycle

```
pending → settled (có kết quả)
       → voided (kỳ bị hủy)
```

### 8.4 Settle pipeline

```
prepare-settle → settle-entries → calculate-financials → apply-split-bonuses → build-report → finalize-settle → sync-ticket-summaries
```

### 8.5 Void pipeline

```
prepare-void → void-entries → dispatch-refunds → finalize-void
```

